        "body": "<p>Dr. Amanda Pearl is a highly skilled dentist dedicated to providing exceptional dental care to her patients. She obtained her Doctor of Dental Medicine (DMD) degree and completed her training in dentistry. With a passion for dentistry, Dr. Pearl is committed to staying updated with the latest advancements in the field to offer the best treatment options for her patients. Her compassionate approach and expertise ensure that patients receive personalized care tailored to their individual needs.</p>",
